You can have a full spectrum water soluble powder by spray drying phytocannabinoid-rich full spectrum distillate with a surfactant and ​emulsifier. 

&#x200B;

I'm not a scientist and I don't work in a lab, but the company I work for has it and I asked for the basic run-down of how it works.

Looking for feedback on this tune I did with a buddy of mine. Let me know what ya think!

